  <title>Net worth</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Reports</gui><gui>Financial</gui><gui>Net
  worth</gui></guiseq> lists the balance of every asset, liability and equity
  account today, as a tree of accounts and their sub-accounts. <gui>Net Worth
  :</gui> is the total. <gui>Expand all</gui> and <gui>Collapse all</gui> open
  and close the tree. <gui>Report hub</gui> exports it; see <link
  xref="report_hub"/>.</p>

</page>
